{"id":116605,"title":{"romaji":"Date A Live IV","english":"Date A Live IV","native":"デート・ア・ライブIV"},"description":"The fourth season of <i>Date A Live</i>.<br>\n<br>\nDespite the numerous challenges he has overcome so far, Shidou Itsuka's mission with Ratatoskr is far from over. In a departure from his daily routine, Shidou encounters a starving woman lying on the street and ends up helping her. After the two arrive at her apartment, the woman introduces herself as Nia Honjou—a popular manga artist working under a pen name. However, cutting straight to the chase, Nia reveals that she is also a Spirit and is aware of Shidou's secret operation.<br>\n<br>\nInterested in seeing his charisma firsthand, Nia challenges Shidou to win her over on a date. As he strives for an opportunity to seal her powers, Shidou learns more about Nia and her history with Deus Ex Machina Industries, a name he is all too familiar with...<br>\n<br>\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx116605-uzDakXnaZ1OW.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx116605-uzDakXnaZ1OW.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx116605-uzDakXnaZ1OW.jpg"},"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/116605-qmByNsRP3c53.jpg","episodes":12,"duration":24,"format":"TV","status":"FINISHED","season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2022,"startDate":{"year":2022,"month":4,"day":8},"endDate":{"year":2022,"month":6,"day":24},"genres":["Action","Comedy","Ecchi","Mecha","Romance","Sci-Fi"],"averageScore":76,"popularity":80939,"studios":{"nodes":[{"name":"GEEKTOYS"}]},"characters":{"nodes":[{"id":65257,"name":{"full":"Shidou Itsuka"},"image":{"medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b65257-fBaWJ3ymyE5m.png"}},{"id":65259,"name":{"full":"Tooka Yatogami"},"image":{"medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/medium/b65259-rKR5JNN